 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 516105,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "At a charity event with 58 people in attendance, 3 raffle winners are chosen. All receive the same prize, so order doesn’t matter. You are attending with 4 of your friends. What is the probability that at least one of you or your friends wins a raffle prize? Hint: Find the probability that none of you wins, and use the formula for complements.\n\n",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "<span data-math=\"1 - \\frac{{_{53}{C_3}}}{{_{58}{C_3}}} \\approx 10.7\\%\">1 - \\frac{{_{53}{C_3}}}{{_{58}{C_3}}} \\approx 10.7\\%</span>"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  },
  {
   "id": 516106,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "If you draw a hand of 5 cards from a standard deck, what is the probability that 2 cards are  <span data-math=\"\\spadesuit\">\\spadesuit</span> and 3 cards are <span data-math=\"♡\">♡</span>?",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>The number of possible five-card hands out of a 52-card deck is <span data-math=\"{\\text{52C5  =  2,598,960}}\"></span>.</p>\n<p>There are 13 cards in each suit.</p>\n<p>The number of ways to draw 2 spades out of 13 spades is <span data-math=\"{\\text{13C2  =  78}}\"></span>.</p>\n<p>The number of ways to draw 3 hearts out of 13 hearts is <span data-math=\"{\\text{13C3  =  286}}\"></span>.</p>\n<p>Use the Multiplication Rule of Counting to count the ways to draw 2 spades and 3 hearts:</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"13{\\text{C}}2{\\text{ }} \\times {\\text{ }}13{\\text{C}}3\"></span></p>\n<p>P(drawing 2 spades and 3 hearts) = <span data-math=\"\\frac{{{\\rm{ways\\; to\\; draw\\; 2\\; spades\\; and\\; 3\\; hearts}}}}{{{\\rm{ways\\; to\\; draw\\; 5\\; cards}}}} = \\frac{{78 \\times 286}}{{2,598,960}} \\approx 0.086\\% \"></span>.</p>\n"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "<span data-math=\"\\frac{{_{13}{C_2}{\\, \\times \\, _{13}}{C_3}}}{{_{52}{C_5}}} \\approx 0.86\\%\">\\frac{{_{13}{C_2}{\\, \\times \\,_{13}}{C_3}}}{{_{52}{C_5}}} \\approx 0.86\\%</span>"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  }
 ],
